                "text": "I am voting NO on the Republican Budget proposal that would take away Medicare and SNAP for over 200,000 working people in CA-12.\n\nIt\u2019s deeply cruel to take away from these critical programs that help everyday Americans get by and give a huge tax break back to billionaires.",
