                "text": "House Republicans' vast cuts in the federal workforce are having deep impacts on Indian Country - a loss of healthcare professionals, childcare services, and legal resources that will left our native American children and families behind. We are going to fight to protect them because they deserve the same resources and rights as any American would. \n\nhttps://t.co/jB4iOXTwbP",
