                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My office has received countless calls from\u00a0 constituents expressing concern about the Republican continuing resolution.\n\nI am voting NO because it guts many critical programs\u00a0 Americans rely on.\n\nIt also provides no protections for Medicaid, Medicare, or Social Security from cuts.",
