                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "House Republicans are putting up the Senate budget resolution for a vote today.\n\nThis budget resolution proposes a minimum of $4 billion in cuts, including cuts that would decimate Medicaid.\n\nThis won\u2019t stand \u2013 I am voting NO.",
