                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week Republicans start to mark-up their budget plan.\n\nThis plan will make $4 trillion in cuts - including cuts to Medicaid, federal workers' retirement programs, Pell grants, Head Start, food assistance programs, & more.\n\nLet's be clear-this plan benefits billionaires & hurts working families.",
