                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last week I met with Dr. Victor Pineda and @TheCILOfficial to talk about the importance of policies that advance accessibility and how the Medicaid cuts in the reconciliation bill will hurt people with disabilities.\n\u00a0\nAs a congenitally blind person myself, I'm committed to advancing disability rights in Congress and am excited to see how we can further innovate for accessibility and inclusion.",
