                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "What\u2019s going on with this horrible cruel Republican bill:\n\nAt 11:50pm last night, Republicans released the text of their bill that will gut Medicaid and SNAP, raise energy prices, and rapidly increase child poverty. Republicans know how deeply unpopular their bill is and that\u2019s why they are trying to ram it through the Senate before anyone can read it and keep Americans in. The. Dark.",
