                "text": "I\u2019m incredibly proud to stand alongside @SenAdamSchiff , @RepAOC and @DonaldNorcross in introducing legislation to ensure striking workers have access to unemployment insurance.\n\u00a0\nFrom the longshore workers of West Oakland to front line workers across the East Bay, no worker should ever have to choose between exercising their right to fair bargaining and putting food on the table for their family. That\u2019s not a level playing field, it\u2019s exploitation.\n\u00a0\nThis bill restores balance, strengthens workers\u2019 voices, and empowers them to fight for better wages and conditions.",
